{
  "id":"npc_shove","title":"当众推搡、见证与乡巡受理","requirements":["N9"],"initial":{"mode":"new"},
  "turns":[
    {"input":"我到青灯酒馆，看看林穗和在场客人。","assertions":[{"kind":"equals","path":"state.location","value":"bld_hw_qingdeng"},{"kind":"equals","path":"state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.location","value":"bld_hw_qingdeng"}]},
    {"input":"我走近林穗，只用手推搡她一下，不用武器，不继续攻击。","assertions":[{"kind":"calls","tool":"world_combat","args":{"intent":"shove"},"success":true,"min":1,"max":1},{"kind":"records","path":"state.records","where":{"category":"legal_case","victim":"npc_hw_linsui"},"min":1},{"kind":"range","path":"state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.trust","max":-1}]},
    {"input":"我立刻收手。林穗和亲眼看到这件事的人现在有什么反应？我不反击，也不替他们决定怎么做。","assertions":[{"kind":"records","path":"state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.memoryStream","where":{"kind":"conflict"},"min":1},{"kind":"calls","tool":"world_combat","min":0,"max":0}]},
    {"input":"我到村口找乡巡顾岑。","assertions":[{"kind":"equals","path":"state.location","value":"loc_hw_gate"}]},
    {"input":"我向顾岑如实自认刚才在酒馆推搡林穗，请他正式受理这件事；现在不交罚款。","assertions":[{"kind":"records","path":"state.records","where":{"category":"legal_case","victim":"npc_hw_linsui","reported":true,"receiver":"npc_hw_gucen"},"min":1},{"kind":"unchanged","paths":["state.player.coins"]}]},
    {"input":"我愿意配合顾岑，若现在已有足够证据依法带我去村务屋候审，我跟着他去，不逃跑。","assertions":[{"kind":"equals","path":"state.location","value":"bld_hw_council"},{"kind":"records","path":"state.records","where":{"category":"legal_custody","reason":"待审","status":"生效"},"min":1}]},
    {"input":"我向在场的陈柏申请正式审理，听完裁定后再决定怎么履行处罚，现在不自动付款或服役。","assertions":[{"kind":"records","path":"state.records","where":{"category":"legal_case","status":"已裁定"},"min":1},{"kind":"unchanged","paths":["state.player.coins"]}]},
    {"input":"（场外）核对实际伤害、目击者、受理经过和待履行的处罚，不推进时间。","assertions":[{"kind":"elapsed","min":0,"max":0},{"kind":"records","path":"state.records","where":{"category":"legal_case","status":"已裁定"},"min":1}]}
  ],
  "rubric":{"truth":"伤害与反击服从交锋结果，未报案时异地顾岑不得自动知情。","agency":"只结算一次推搡；配合候审不等于已同意罚款或服役。","language":"人物自然说话，不用状态表替代反应。","continuity":"N9：林穗实际反击或呼救，在场见证者对真实推搡作出反应；顾岑收到自认后正式受理并依法介入。不得把只有一句喊话算作完整后果，不得让未在场者自称亲眼所见。"}
}
